> I've been lurking this newsgroup for a while now and it seems a lot of
> characters use different names for each of there characters. Is there
> any difference to gameplay if you use a different name?

I think there is only one difference: If you anger a shopkeeper, die on
this level and leave a bones file, and later some character with the same
name gets this bones file, the shopkeeper will be angry towards you. (And
the Croesus stuff.)

